      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "昔はウチの町も、旅人が毎日たくさん立ち寄って、\nそれはそれは賑わったもんなのさ。\n今じゃ畑を荒らすスナブタしか寄りつきゃしない……\nひとつ、派手な踊りで町を活気づかせておくれよ。",
        "official_en": "Used to be a time when our town was bustling—we\nhad travelers here every day. Now our only visitors\nare sand boars laying waste to our fields... Please,\nbring some life to the town with your flashy dancing.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
