        "branch_phase": null,
        "authored_group": "MSQID_Comp_LED_ShowProvince5"
      },
      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "あんたの踊り、実に大したもんだなあ！\n大人だけじゃなくて、ガキどもも大喜びさ。\nこれで少しは賑わいが戻るといいが……\nま、そう簡単じゃあねえよな。また来ておくれよ！",
        "official_en": "Your dancing is staggering! That brought joy to the\nadults and children alike. I wish it brought some\nmore people to town...but, well, that's not so simple.",
        "real_en": null
      },
